        "consequence": "Any detector of type `metric_alert_fire` crashes `process_detectors` with a TypeError, so one such detector aborts processing of the whole detector list. Previously it was a harmless no-op.",
        "evidence_refs": [
          "source:new:src/sentry/incidents/grouptype.py@sha256:f99c8f7e81399b956f8772e4d79c5f7714043c219eb2d619037d1ca91dc9fb6d",
